  "description": "config.yaml's worker.device_logins_max (OPEN-R3 (a)): the most device logins one principal may have in progress, an integer from 1 to 64, answered 429 `rate_limited` past it (device-login step 5). Optional in this schema; the core's loader refuses to start without it, as it does for worker.open_timeout. The range is the schema's. Valid: 8; 1; 64; absent. Invalid: 0; 65; a string; a non-integer.",
  "corpus": [
    "Storage §2.5",
    "decision 5.36",
    "device-login step 5, bounds"
  ],
